 'Record diagram legs into Vinanzas sum to USD 75,840,066.88, which is USD 221,537.25 short of the USD 76,061,604.13 received. The press figures (20,000,000 + 35,000,000 + 10,049,628.97 + 4,678,670.99 + 2,117,596.26 + 4,215,707.91) equal 76,061,604.13 exactly; the gap is explained by three small-print readings (ITTI 204,000.99 low, Model 17,596.26 low, Grupo Vázquez 60.00 high). Received less paid leaves USD 1,643,186.01 in Vinanzas with no use shown. Uses of USD (76,061,604.13 to Vinanzas plus 6,321,574 for the Grupo M overdraft) exceed the five loans by USD 542,178.13, and ITTI paid out USD 1,000,000.78 more than the Technoma money it received; the source of that difference is not in the data. The Factopar and La Tropa Fletes splits between Kasas, Grupo Vázquez, Model and ITTI are not given.',
